{"4053140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catgirl Gemfall", "steam_appid": 4053140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is <strong>Catgirl Gemfall? It's</strong> BATTLE-PACHINKO and collecting trading cards with CATGIRLS? It's a coin pusher game that combines puzzle, luck, trading cards with addictive scoring gameplay. It's a physics sandbox. It's the new dopamine machine.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/extras/fbc5a42a52c696d5a179c1c9741ead22.avif?t=1765337411\" width=1526 height=637 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever heard of a coin-pusher card battler? Nope. Use ACTUAL PHYSICS to trigger score combos, morphs, and explosive chain reactions as gems tumble, multiply, and rain down the board. Summon the Gem Fairy, mess with physics, and get lucky in a fight against the evil spreading corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive Catgirl-arcade coin-pusher experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Score big</strong> by testing merge effects between Catgirls. <br>💎 <strong>Unlock new arenas</strong>, every Shrine is a puzzle within itself. <br>😼 <strong>Convert rival Catgirls</strong> anyone you beat, you unlock!<br>✨ <strong>Unleash abilities</strong>: icy blasts, magnetic pulls, gem storms, and morphing coins that defy the rules of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/extras/f5bc1687a2a22e582359f4e7efb4cee3.avif?t=1765337411\" width=1560 height=777 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drop is a new disaster (or jackpot) waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy skill (and a little luck) to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flood the board with gem storms and fairy blessings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morph silver coins into ingots, magnets, or gem-spawning chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit physics, edges, and sometimes just outright lose (or cheat)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop coins, cause chaos, and let the gems fall — <strong>Catgirl Gemfall</strong> isn’t just about shiny treasures. It’s about saving the Catgirls, building a team and saving the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Booster Pack DLC on the horizon ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/extras/451787d14949a8bba9767d20b88e9f8b.avif?t=1765337411\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is <strong>Catgirl Gemfall? It's</strong> BATTLE-PACHINKO and collecting trading cards with CATGIRLS? It's a coin pusher game that combines puzzle, luck, trading cards with addictive scoring gameplay. It's a physics sandbox. It's the new dopamine machine.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/extras/fbc5a42a52c696d5a179c1c9741ead22.avif?t=1765337411\" width=1526 height=637 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever heard of a coin-pusher card battler? Nope. Use ACTUAL PHYSICS to trigger score combos, morphs, and explosive chain reactions as gems tumble, multiply, and rain down the board. Summon the Gem Fairy, mess with physics, and get lucky in a fight against the evil spreading corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive Catgirl-arcade coin-pusher experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Score big</strong> by testing merge effects between Catgirls. <br>💎 <strong>Unlock new arenas</strong>, every Shrine is a puzzle within itself. <br>😼 <strong>Convert rival Catgirls</strong> anyone you beat, you unlock!<br>✨ <strong>Unleash abilities</strong>: icy blasts, magnetic pulls, gem storms, and morphing coins that defy the rules of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/extras/f5bc1687a2a22e582359f4e7efb4cee3.avif?t=1765337411\" width=1560 height=777 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drop is a new disaster (or jackpot) waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy skill (and a little luck) to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flood the board with gem storms and fairy blessings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morph silver coins into ingots, magnets, or gem-spawning chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit physics, edges, and sometimes just outright lose (or cheat)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop coins, cause chaos, and let the gems fall — <strong>Catgirl Gemfall</strong> isn’t just about shiny treasures. It’s about saving the Catgirls, building a team and saving the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Booster Pack DLC on the horizon ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/extras/451787d14949a8bba9767d20b88e9f8b.avif?t=1765337411\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Catgirl Gemfall is a magical coin pusher arcade blast, mixing wild physics, sparkling gems, and collectible Catgirl player cards. A pure dopamine factory of chain reactions and shiny rewards. Bright, chaotic, and effortlessly fun for every kind of gamer.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/3e9d3e8dd7d431799c1d444aebac72445f52054a/header.jpg?t=1765337411", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053140/71c6610ee6fda0c479eaeb2efa71fc6724717e